{"headword":"עוֹף","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:17\" href=\"/Genesis.40.17\">Gn 40:17</a> <strong>coll. flying</strong> creatures, fowl, insects;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:20\" href=\"/Genesis.1.20\">Gn 1:20</a> +, cstr. v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:21\" href=\"/Genesis.1.21\">21</a> +;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>fowl birds</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:17\" href=\"/Genesis.40.17\">Gn 40:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 40:19\" href=\"/Genesis.40.19\">19</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:8\" href=\"/Genesis.7.8\">7:8</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:20\" href=\"/Genesis.1.20\">1:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:22\" href=\"/Genesis.1.22\">22</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.13\">1 K 5:13</a> +; especially (38 times) <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ הַשָּׁמַיִם</span> <em>fowl of the sky</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:19\" href=\"/Genesis.2.19\">Gn 2:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:20\" href=\"/Genesis.2.20\">20</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:26\" href=\"/Genesis.1.26\">1:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:28\" href=\"/Genesis.1.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:30\" href=\"/Genesis.1.30\">30</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:20\" href=\"/Hosea.2.20\">Ho 2:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:20\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.20\">Ec 10:20</a> +, carrion birds <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:44\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.44\">1 S 17:44</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:46\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.46\">46</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:10\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.10\">2 S 21:10</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.11\">1 K 14:11</a> + 11 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ הָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:11\" href=\"/Psalms.50.11\">ψ 50:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ נוֹדֵד</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.2\">Is 16:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּכְלוּב מָלֵא ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:27\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.27\">Je 5:27</a>; redundantly <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ כָּנָף</span> <em>fowl of wing</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 1:21\" href=\"/Genesis.1.21\">Gn 1:21</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:27\" href=\"/Psalms.78.27\">ψ 78:27</a> (for food); for food also <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:26\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.26\">Lv 7:26</a> (P), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.13\">17:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 20:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.20.25\">20:25</a> (both H), cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.13\">Lv 11:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:46\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.46\">46</a> (H, clean and unclean); for offering <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:20\" href=\"/Genesis.8.20\">Gn 8:20</a> (J; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳ הַטָּהוֹר</span>), <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.14\">Lv 1:14</a> (P)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>winged insects</em> (clean and unclean) <span dir=\"rtl\">שֶׁרֶץ הָע׳ הַהֹלֵךְ עַל־אַרְבַּע</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.20\">Lv 11:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.21\">21</a> (H), <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ הָע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.19\">Dt 14:19</a>, so prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">הָע׳</span> alone v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.20\">20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳ הָע׳ אֲשֶׁר־לוֹ אַרְבַּע רַגְלָ֑יִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 11:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.11.23\">Lv 11:23</a> (H)."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB07100","strong_numbers":["5775"],"next_hw":"עַפְעַף","prev_hw":"עוּף","occurrences":"70","quotes":[],"GK":["6416"],"TWOT":["1582a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_